/*	Cyclone-timer: 
 *		This code implements timer_ops for the cyclone counter found
 *		on IBM x440, x360, and other Summit based systems.
 *
 *	Copyright (C) 2002 IBM, John Stultz (johnstul@us.ibm.com)
